<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NeoMagic downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NeoMagic downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Friday it lowered its rating on NeoMagic Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Late Thursday, NeoMagic reported pro forma second quarter income of $0.15 per share versus a loss of $0.06 per share in the comparable period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-7/8 to 20-1/2.</p>
</text>
